\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Two complementary forms of dynamics that recur throughout this thesis. The two representations differ in their nature, conceptual level, and primary carrier.}}{4}{table.caption.15}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1.2}{\ignorespaces The three core supervision scenarios studied in this thesis. Each scenario specifies the available data, the missing expressive layer, and the target output.}}{6}{table.caption.22}%
