\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2.7}{\ignorespaces Representative datasets relevant to expressive label recovery in this thesis. Each dataset is summarised by its instrument family, scale, and the expressive modalities (MIDI, velocity, score, score dynamics) it provides.}}{35}{table.caption.43}%
